{
  "server": "jp",
  "storyId": "main_3_level_main_03-04_end",
  "groupId": "main_3",
  "stageId": "main_03-04",
  "title": "亀裂",
  "storyCode": "3-4",
  "avgTag": "戦闘後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/jp/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9bc55b2533cc119c72458beb21bf0b2164144750370376e944e259ab72f76e39",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "どういうこと……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "小隊を一つ潰しただけなのに……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "って言っても、でっかいのはきっちり倒したじゃない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "これで終わりって言ってくれないかしら。あれの相手で疲れてるんだけど。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "そうはいかないでしょうね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "あんなにも多くの感染者たちが、跡形もなくどこかへ消えるとは思えません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "それに、先ほどの大柄な相手も、単なる囮と考えるには奇妙です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そもそも、この短時間で離脱なんてできるものでしょうか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "退路は近衛局が塞いでいるはずですし……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "ここ……何かおかしいとは思うんだけど。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "手がかりは一つも見当たらないのよね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "草地に廃墟、それから砂丘……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "待ち伏せするにはぴったりの場所なのに。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "新しい足跡どころか、衣服が草に擦れる音や、火薬の匂いすらも……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "何一つないだなんて。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "あ～あ。わけわかんないわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "ねえ、ペンギン急便のお二人さんで何とかしてくれない？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "だって、こんな状況、超不自然だし――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "――静かに。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "何か聞こえます。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "何か、って――ん？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "ひょっとして……地面の下から聞こえてる！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "――アーミヤ！　相手は下だ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ッ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "ドクター！　伏せてください！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "この連中……！　なんと姑息な！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "なっ……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "今のを……受け止めた、のか……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我が盾――「般若」を貫くことなど、できはしない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "……それは、どうかな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "――ッ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "何なの、この熱……って、あれは……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "まさか、アーツユニットごと自爆するつもり！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "ドクター、離れて！　その距離じゃ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "こ、のッ……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "これで……終わりだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "や……やめて……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ダメ――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ドクターを、傷つけないでっ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#8",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ぐ、っ……ご、ほっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……っ、あ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……なんて……力、だ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "これ、は……一体……何、なんだ……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "…………いや。お前、の……実力、か……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "げほ、っ…………く、そっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……こんな、力が……ある、くせにっ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "…………苦、しむ……同胞、たちを……ただ、見過ごす……なんて……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "許、せない……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……俺は……お前、らを……許、さ……ない……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "………………"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "…………そ……んな……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ミーシャ",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "いや……い、いやああっ……！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
